  "body": "PR #2461 implements a release-gate work queue and narrows suite isolation. Its latest pre-review requires an issue reference and a scheduling decision record before merge. This issue tracks that existing implementation; it does not expand the PR.\n\nScope: prebuild first, schedule shared steps through budgeted lanes in longest-first order using prior release timings, and retain exclusive execution for UI, build, clippy and named watchdog suites. Preserve suite failure reporting and checkout guards.\n\nDone means: PR #2461 has the required process-change declaration, closing issue reference and decision record; its existing scheduler tests and quick gate pass. Full release performance measurements remain unverified and are not claimed here.\n\nPriority: P5 because this maintains gate/process tooling. effort:high because the implementation adds scheduler behavior and executor tests within xtask; no safety-floor product code changes.\n\nProcess change: yes\n",
